  {"section":"1.1.5(c)","page":2,"text":"an tAthair Peadar Ua Laoghaire","phrase":true},
  {"section":"1.1.5(c)","page":2,"text":"an Captaen Ó Murchú","phrase":true},
  {"section":"1.1.5(c)","page":2,"text":"an tUachtarán Mhic Róibín","phrase":true},
  {"section":"1.1.5(c)","page":2,"text":"an Teachta de Barra","phrase":true},
  {"section":"1.1.5(c)","page":2,"text":"an Múinteoir Ailbhe","phrase":true},
  {"section":"1.1.5(c)","page":2,"text":"an Pápa Eoin Pól II","phrase":true},
  {"section":"1.1.5(c)","page":2,"text":"an Rí Anraí VIII","phrase":true},
  {"section":"1.1.5(c)","page":2,"text":"Ba é an tAthair Peadar Ua Laoghaire a scríobh an dráma An Sprid."},
  {"section":"1.1.5(c)","page":2,"text":"Labhair an Captaen Ó Murchú leis na himreoirí."},
  {"section":"1.1.5(c)","page":2,"text":"Bhí an tUachtarán Mhic Róibín le feiceáil sa ghrianghraf."},
  {"section":"1.1.5(c)","page":2,"text":"Beidh an Dochtúir de Barra ar saoire ar feadh seachtaine."},
  {"section":"1.1.5(c)","page":2,"text":"Tá an Múinteoir Ailbhe i bhfeighil ar rang a sé i mbliana."},
  {"section":"1.1.5(c)","page":2,"text":"Is í an Bhanríon Elsa a Dó atá sa scannán."},
