  {"section":"1.1.5(e)","page":2,"text":"an Mháirt","phrase":true},
  {"section":"1.1.5(e)","page":2,"text":"an Chéadaoin","phrase":true},
  {"section":"1.1.5(e)","page":2,"text":"Is é an Luan an lá is ansa liom."},
  {"section":"1.1.5(e)","page":2,"text":"Téim ag snámh ar an Máirt."},
  {"section":"1.1.5(e)","page":2,"text":"Inniu an Chéadaoin."},
  {"section":"1.1.5(e)","page":2,"text":"Bhí mé ag caint leis Dé Céadaoin seo caite."},
  {"section":"1.1.5(e)","page":2,"text":"Ní mór na hiarratais a bheith faighte faoin Aoine, an 16 Bealtaine."},
  {"section":"1.1.5(f)","page":2,"text":"san Aibreán","phrase":true},
  {"section":"1.1.5(f)","page":2,"text":"Is minic a bhíonn mí Eanáir níos fuaire ná mí na Nollag."},
  {"section":"1.1.5(f)","page":2,"text":"Tá an Cháisc i mí an Mhárta seachas mí Aibreáin i mbliana."},
  {"section":"1.1.5(g)","page":3,"text":"Ba chóir é a dhéanamh tráth nach déanaí ná an 30 Meán Fómhair gach bliain."},
  {"section":"1.1.5(g)","page":3,"text":"Beidh an chóisir ar siúl ar an 12 Aibreán."},
