  {"section":"1.5.1","page":11,"text":"Cár fhág tú eochair an chairr?"},
  {"section":"1.5.1","page":11,"text":"Tá muintir na háite sásta le foireann na leabharlainne."},
  {"section":"1.5.1","page":11,"text":"Is maith leis na gasúir a bheith ag réiteach an dinnéir."},
  {"section":"1.5.1","page":11,"text":"Is í Síle atá ag déanamh na hArdteiste i mbliana."},
  {"section":"1.5.1","page":11,"text":"faoi chomhair","phrase":true},
  {"section":"1.5.1","page":11,"text":"i gcás","phrase":true},
  {"section":"1.5.1","page":11,"text":"le haghaidh","phrase":true},
  {"section":"1.5.1","page":11,"text":"Bíonn an cat ina shuí ansin os comhair na tine gach uile oíche."},
  {"section":"1.5.1","page":11,"text":"Ba iad na hailtirí a bhí i mbun an scrúdaithe."},
  {"section":"1.5.1","page":11,"text":"Chuala mé go ndeachaigh sibh ar thuras timpeall an domhain."},
  {"section":"1.5.1","page":11,"text":"Shiúlamar cois na habhann."},
  {"section":"1.5.1","page":11,"text":"Tá an grúpa uile ag dul chun na Spáinne i mí Iúil."},
  {"section":"1.5.1","page":11,"text":"Rinne siad achomharc chun na cúirte."},
